    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπν-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drowsy,</i>
